) (justify left top)) (uuid "3aae7821-6d37-5cd9-b4f9-2e2ad5b7a10c"))(text "5. 0.5 mohm: 80 A sürekli varsayımında I²R=3.2 W üst sınır\nhesabı. Gerçek şönt RMS akımı PWM ile değişir." (at 300 90.80000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0dd6ce15-5199-543f-94fb-837740f5f631"))(text "6. PCB: paralel kollar simetrik; ortak kaynak endüktansı\nazaltılır. Tab pin2=Drain. Soğutucu izolasyonu ayrıca\ntasarlanır." (at 300 101.50000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7165d060-bf94-5140-90a1-ae8cafe5908a"))(text "7. AÇIK R03: şönt pad yönü/termal. AÇIK R04: double-pulse ve\nkısa devre koruma süresi." (at 300 114.55000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "613bae66-8625-5fed-ace1-e53c8f835e26"))(polyline (pts (xy 292 35) (xy 292 256)) (stroke (width .254) (type default)) (uuid "680249ad-a6dd-5491-a0d8-9ba8bd1a27c6"))(symbol (lib_id "ESC_B1:NMOS") (at 101.6 81.28 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "98bd429f-2448-56a6-9b55-ce1497f644ec")(property "Reference" "Q401" (at 101.6 66.66 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) ))(property "Value" "CSD19536KTT" (at 101.6 69.66 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) ))(property "Footprint" "Package_TO_SOT_SMD:TO-263-3_TabPin2" (at 101.6 66.66 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (hide yes)))(property "MPN" "CSD19536KTT" (at 101.6 66.66 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (hide yes)))(property "Review" "Pin 2 is drain tab. Parallel pair requires symmetric routing and separate gate resistor." (at 101.6 66.66 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (hide yes)))(property "A1_Reference" "Q9" (at 101.6 66.66 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (hide yes)))(pin "1" (uuid "e7e02bf4-f614-512c-be2b-e3ce05c418e0"))(pin "2" (uuid "9dc64c2c-f8ac-5786-a1f2-b5a4e1fdd210"))(pin "3" (uuid "a900ba68-ba7d-58c3-9c17-53277ba0488e"))(instances (project "ESC_3kW_B1" (path "/94017d30-9420-5ccb-9001-09c9da30ecde/801ac83d-aea2-5c95-9b03-6feeaf66e43d" (refere